# SaaS Product Plan — Real Estate CRM Platform

## Vision
A **multi-tenant SaaS CRM** sold to real estate agencies across India.
Each agency signs up, gets their own isolated workspace, connects their lead sources,
and manages their entire sales pipeline from one dashboard.

