### Phase 2 — Subscription Plans & Billing (Week 2–3)

**Goal:** Agencies pay monthly. You earn recurring revenue.

#### Plans:

| Plan | Price | Agents | Leads/month | Features |
|------|-------|--------|-------------|---------|
| **Starter** (Free trial) | ₹0 / 14 days | 2 | 100 | Core CRM |
| **Growth** | ₹1,999/mo | 10 | 1,000 | + Webhooks, email alerts |
| **Pro** | ₹4,999/mo | 30 | 10,000 | + WhatsApp, portal parsers |
| **Enterprise** | ₹12,999/mo | Unlimited | Unlimited | + White-label, API, priority support |

#### Billing tech stack:
- **Razorpay** (best for India, UPI/cards/net banking)
- Store subscription status on `Tenant` model
- Enforce limits via middleware (e.g., block lead creation if monthly limit hit)

#### Backend changes:
```prisma
model Subscription {
  id            String   @id @default(cuid())
  tenantId      String   @unique
  plan          String   // starter | growth | pro | enterprise
  status        String   // trial | active | past_due | cancelled
  trialEndsAt   DateTime?
  currentPeriodEnd DateTime?
  razorpaySubId String?
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime @updatedAt

  tenant        Tenant   @relation(fields: [tenantId], references: [id])
}
```

```
POST /api/billing/create-subscription
POST /api/billing/webhook              ← Razorpay payment events
GET  /api/billing/plans
GET  /api/billing/current
POST /api/billing/cancel
```

