### Phase 7 — Mobile PWA (Week 6)

**Goal:** Agents use the CRM on their phones in the field.

#### What makes it mobile-ready:
- Responsive CSS (already partially done in Next.js)
- PWA manifest + service worker → "Add to Home Screen" like an app
- Mobile-first pages: Lead detail, Quick status update, Click-to-call
- Offline support: View last-fetched leads without internet

#### Key mobile screens:
```
Home:     My leads today | Follow-ups due
Lead:     One-tap call | WhatsApp | Status change
Add lead: Quick add form (name + phone minimum)
Tasks:    Today's follow-up list
```

No app store needed — agents just open the browser and install it as a PWA.

