## Tech Stack

### Current (keep as-is):
| Layer | Tech |
|-------|------|
| Frontend | Next.js 15, TypeScript |
| Backend | NestJS, TypeScript |
| Database | PostgreSQL |
| ORM | Prisma |
| Auth | JWT |

### Add for SaaS:
| Layer | Tech | Why |
|-------|------|-----|
| Billing | Razorpay | India-first, UPI support |
| Email | Resend or SendGrid | Transactional emails |
| WhatsApp | Meta Cloud API / Wati | Lead notifications |
| File storage | Cloudflare R2 or AWS S3 | Logo / document uploads |
| Caching | Redis | Session & rate limiting |
| Job queue | BullMQ + Redis | Async jobs (email, webhooks) |
| Deployment | Railway or AWS | Live public URL |
| Domain | PropCRM.in or similar | Your SaaS brand |

